  "flavor_text": {
    "one_line": "Desert visionaries who follow ecstatic prophetesses from oasis shrine to oasis shrine.",
    "one_paragraph": "The Suthrali speak of revelation as a moving thing that refuses any palace built to confine it. Their caravans carry salts, incense, and fragments of prophecy between oasis shrines ruled by singer-seers. Though devout, they reject fixed hierarchies unless sanctified by living charisma, and they prefer a dangerous honest desert to the comfort of a well-administered cage."
